                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.2.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alichomwamuru Mose. Hivyo ndivyo walivyopiga kambi chini ya alama zao, pia hivyo ndivyo walivyoondoka, kila mmoja akiwa na ukoo wake na jamaa yake.",
